              "text": {
                "en": "Here $a = 2$, $b = -4$, $c = 5$. Discriminant $D = b^2 - 4ac = (-4)^2 - 4(2)(5) = 16 - 40 = -24$.",
                "ne": "यहाँ $a = 2$, $b = -4$, $c = 5$। विभेदक $D = b^2 - 4ac = (-4)^2 - 4(2)(5) = 16 - 40 = -24$।"
              }
            }
          ],
          "finalAnswer": {
            "en": "$D = -24$",
            "ne": "$D = -24$"
          },
          "marks": 2
        },
        {
          "partId": "b",
          "solutionSteps": [
            {
              "step": 1,
              "text": {
                "en": "Since $D = -24 < 0$, the equation has no real roots; the roots are imaginary.",
                "ne": "$D = -24 < 0$ भएकोले, यस समीकरणको कुनै वास्तविक मूल हुँदैन; मूलहरू काल्पनिक हुन्छन्।"
              }
            }
          ],
          "finalAnswer": {
            "en": "No real roots (imaginary roots)",
            "ne": "वास्तविक मूल छैन (काल्पनिक मूल)"
          },
          "marks": 2
        }
      ],
      "marksTotal": 4
    },
    {
      "questionId": "q4",
      "type": "multi-part",
      "parts": [
        {
          "partId": "a",
          "solutionSteps": [
            {
              "step": 1,
              "text": {
                "en": "Let the smaller integer be $x$, so the next consecutive integer is $x + 1$.",
                "ne": "सानो पूर्णाङ्कलाई $x$ मानौं, त्यसपछिको क्रमागत पूर्णाङ्क $x + 1$ हुन्छ।"
              }
            },
            {
              "step": 2,
              "text": {
                "en": "Their product is 132, so $x(x+1) = 132 \\Rightarrow x^2 + x - 132 = 0$.",
                "ne": "तिनको गुणनफल 132 भएकोले, $x(x+1) = 132 \\Rightarrow x^2 + x - 132 = 0$।"
              }
            }
          ],
          "finalAnswer": {
            "en": "$x^2 + x - 132 = 0$",
            "ne": "$x^2 + x - 132 = 0$"
          },
          "marks": 2
        },
        {
          "partId": "b",
          "solutionSteps": [
            {
              "step": 1,
              "text": {
                "en": "We need two numbers whose product is $-132$ and sum is $1$: these are $12$ and $-11$.",
                "ne": "गुणनफल $-132$ र योगफल $1$ हुने दुई संख्या चाहिन्छ: ती हुन् $12$ र $-11$।"
              }
            },
            {
              "step": 2,
              "text": {
                "en": "$x^2 + 12x - 11x - 132 = 0 \\Rightarrow x(x+12) - 11(x+12) = 0 \\Rightarrow (x+12)(x-11) = 0$",
                "ne": "$x^2 + 12x - 11x - 132 = 0 \\Rightarrow x(x+12) - 11(x+12) = 0 \\Rightarrow (x+12)(x-11) = 0$"
              }
            },
            {
              "step": 3,
              "text": {
                "en": "So $x = -12$ or $x = 11$. Since the integers must be positive, $x = 11$.",
                "ne": "त्यसैले $x = -12$ वा $x = 11$। पूर्णाङ्कहरू धनात्मक हुनुपर्ने भएकोले, $x = 11$।"
              }
            },
            {
              "step": 4,
              "text": {
                "en": "The two consecutive integers are $11$ and $12$. Check: $11 \\times 12 = 132$.",
                "ne": "दुई क्रमागत पूर्णाङ्कहरू $11$ र $12$ हुन्। जाँच: $11 \\times 12 = 132$।"
              }
            }
          ],
          "finalAnswer": {
            "en": "The integers are $11$ and $12$",
            "ne": "पूर्णाङ्कहरू $11$ र $12$ हुन्"
          },
          "marks": 3
        }
      ],
      "marksTotal": 5
